# --- Real LMU telemetry exports contain driver PII: NEVER commit them. ---
# The only telemetry allowed in the repo is the sanitized fixture triple
# (Ring 0, TESTING_GATES.md G0.1/G0.2). It's explicitly re-included below in
# two places: fixtures/ (CI's Ring 0/1/4 truth data) and
# frontend/public/fixtures/ (a duplicate copy so the browser can fetch() it
# for demo-session seeding — see frontend/src/lib/demo.js). Both copies are
# the same already-sanitized triple; this is not a new PII surface.
*.ld
*.ldx
*.svm
!fixtures/*.ld
!fixtures/*.ldx
!fixtures/*.svm
!frontend/public/fixtures/*.ld
!frontend/public/fixtures/*.ldx
!frontend/public/fixtures/*.svm

# Dependencies & build output
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vercel/

# Environment & secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Logs
*.log
